## Color Customization

### Method 1: Update CSS Variables

Change colors by modifying CSS variables in `globals.css`:

```css
:root {
  --primary: 262.1 83.3% 57.8%;  /* Purple */
  --primary-foreground: 210 20% 98%;
}

.dark {
  --primary: 263.4 70% 50.4%;  /* Darker purple */
  --primary-foreground: 210 20% 98%;
}
